SDE-FLTK changes (Selviana DE Project)

1.3.11-sde3  2026-10-24
  - X11: Fl_X::before_map, called right before a new top-level window is
    mapped for the first time, so programs can set _NET_WM_WINDOW_TYPE and
    _NET_WM_STATE before a window manager starts managing the window.

1.3.11-sde2  2026-10-21
  - FL/Fl_SDE_Style.H: theme hooks. With a style installed (fl_sde_style()),
    popup menus use a padded layout with variable item heights, icons and a
    row of quick actions (FL_MENU_SDE_QUICK items), and are drawn by the
    style; Fl_Menu_Bar (with hover), Fl_Choice, Fl_Scrollbar, Fl_Return_Button
    and the tooltip window ask the style first; fl_ask.H dialogs and
    Fl_File_Chooser are passed to the style before they are shown.
    Left/Right move along the quick row. Without a style nothing changes.
  - Menus that would leave the work area move into it (styled menus only).
  - X11 drag and drop: a file list that Fl::dnd() announces as
    "text/uri-list" is also served in that type, so GTK file managers
    accept files dragged from SDE programs (the desktop).

1.3.11-sde1  2026-10-20
  - Imported FLTK 1.3.11 into the SDE repository as SDE-FLTK.
  - Removed test/example programs, IDE files, documentation sources and the
    bundled zlib/libjpeg/libpng (system libraries are used).
  - FL/sde_fltk.h: SDE_FLTK_VERSION for SDE programs ("About" pages).
